                                                "sense_id": "dc90248d-3910-32a4-9c99-d36ac1af93bd",
                                                "text": "We Americans have not so much need to take his admonitions to heart as Continental Europeans, seeing that captious critics are prone to regard us as suffering rather from gynocentrism than anthropocentrism."
